rooms_desc ({"On the wall you can see the pictures of nacked chickens.On the ground are a lot of gold coins.","The walls are pink and the light is red.You can bring your girl(mud)friend to this room.","A lot of pencils and rubbers are here.In the corner lies a voodo doll which looks like Muzmuz.","This is the rest room. A bed stands in front of a big window.On the east wall hangs a big picture of Muzmuz. In his left eye sticks a rusty nail.","This is the living room of Flohkraut.","This is a long floor.","This is the arrest room of Flohkraut's house.All people who are stupid stay here for more then 20 seconds.You give 10000 coins to Flohkraut.","This is the disco room of Flohkraut. You can see a real big CD-playerin the west corner. All around you are flashlights. Have a got timehere.There is a sign.","This is the kitchen of Flohkraut. Food is everywhere on the floor.Do not eat if you want to live.","This room is empty.",})
